text: ['({B/R} can be paid with either {B} or {R}.)\\nFlying\\nWhen Avatar of Discord enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you discard two cards.', '({B/R} can be paid with either {B} or {R}.)\\n{3}{B}, Discard a card: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.\\n{3}{R}: Create a 2/1 red Goblin creature token with haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step.', '({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {R}{R}{R}{R}{R}.', 'All Saprolings get +1/+1.\\nMorph {3}{G}{G} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Thelonite Hermit is turned face up, create four 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.', "All creatures able to block Shinen of Life's Roar do so.\\nChannel — {2}{G}{G}, Discard Shinen of Life's Roar: All creatures able to block target creature this turn do so.", 'All creatures get -2/-2 until end of turn.', 'Amplify 3 (As this creature enters the battlefield, put three +1/+1 counters on it for each Dragon card you reveal in your hand.)\\nFlying\\n{T}: Kilnmouth Dragon deals damage equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on it to any target.', "Artifacts you control have hexproof. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities your opponents control.)", 'As long as Thunderstaff is untapped, if a creature would deal combat damage to you, prevent 1 of that damage.\\n{2}, {T}: Attacking creatures get +1/+0 until end of turn.', "At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, Skullcage deals 2 damage to that player unless they have exactly three or exactly four cards in hand.", 'Barren Moor enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B}.\\nCycling {B} ({B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Cascade (When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card that costs less. You may cast it without paying its mana cost. Put the exiled cards on the bottom of your library in a random order.)\\nBituminous Blast deals 4 damage to target creature.', "Chandra's Outrage deals 4 damage to target creature and 2 damage to that creature's controller.", 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nProtection from black\\n{2}{G}{G}: Chameleon Colossus gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is its power.', 'Changeling (This card is every creature type.)\\nWhenever an opponent casts a spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Taurean Mauler.', 'Choose one or both —\\n• Branching Bolt deals 3 damage to target creature with flying.\\n• Branching Bolt deals 3 damage to target creature without flying.', "Choose two —\\n• Target player gains 7 life.\\n• Put target noncreature permanent on top of its owner's library.\\n• Target player shuffles their graveyard into their library.\\n• Search your library for a creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.", 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Creatures you control have haste.\\nSacrifice Fires of Yavimaya: Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Cycling {2}{G} ({2}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Krosan Tusker, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle. (Do this before you draw.)', 'Defender\\nPut a -0/-1 counter on Wall of Roots: Add {G}. Activate only once each turn.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\\nConspire (As you cast this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', "Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Discard two cards: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Dragon spells you cast cost {2} less to cast.', 'Draw three cards.', "Each noncreature artifact is an artifact creature with power and toughness each equal to its mana value. (Equipment that's a creature can't equip a creature.)", 'Echo {2}{G} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Hunting Moa enters the battlefield or dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has reach. (It can block creatures with flying.)\\nTotem armor (If enchanted creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage from it and destroy this Aura.)', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has trample.\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage, you gain that much life.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has haste.\\n{R}: Enchanted creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nWhen a creature with mana value 6 or greater enters the battlefield, you may return Dragon Breath from your graveyard to the battlefield attached to that creature.', "Equipped creature has haste and shroud. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities.)\\nEquip {0}", 'Exile target creature.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "Fear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\nWhen Shriekmaw enters the battlefield, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature.\\nEvoke {1}{B} (You may cast this spell for its evoke cost. If you do, it's sacrificed when it enters the battlefield.)", 'Feral Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{3}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Feral Hydra. Any player may activate this ability.', 'Fertilid enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}{G}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Fertilid: Target player searches their library for a basic land card, puts it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffles.', 'First strike\\nMorph {1}{R}{R} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Flash\\nWhen Ethersworn Shieldmage enters the battlefield, prevent all damage that would be dealt to artifact creatures this turn.', 'Flying, haste\\nWhenever Hellkite Charger attacks, you may pay {5}{R}{R}. If you do, untap all attacking creatures and after this phase, there is an additional combat phase.', "Flying\\nMenace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\nTwo-Headed Dragon can block an additional creature each combat.\\n{1}{R}: Two-Headed Dragon gets +2/+0 until end of turn.", 'Flying\\nMorph {6}{R}{R} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Imperial Hellkite is turned face up, you may search your library for a Dragon card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "Flying\\nWhen Magister Sphinx enters the battlefield, target player's life total becomes 10.", 'Flying\\nWhen Ryusei, the Falling Star dies, it deals 5 damage to each creature without flying.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sanctum Gargoyle enters the battlefield, you may return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Flameblast Dragon attacks, you may pay {X}{R}. If you do, Flameblast Dragon deals X damage to any target.', 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Vampiric Dragon this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Vampiric Dragon.\\n{1}{R}: Vampiric Dragon deals 1 damage to target creature.', 'Flying\\nWhenever another creature leaves the battlefield, you may have target player mill two cards.\\nUnearth {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Flying\\n{R}: Dragon Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn. If this ability has been activated four or more times this turn, sacrifice Dragon Whelp at the beginning of the next end step.', 'Flying\\n{R}: Furnace Whelp gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', "Forestwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls a Forest.)\\nWhen Yavimaya Dryad enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a Forest card, put it onto the battlefield tapped under target player's control, then shuffle.", 'Graypelt Refuge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Graypelt Refuge enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Hellbent — Gathan Raiders gets +2/+2 as long as you have no cards in hand.\\nMorph—Discard a card. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Hideaway 4 (When this land enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library, exile one face down, then put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)\\nMosswort Bridge enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: You may play the exiled card without paying its mana cost if creatures you control have total power 10 or greater.', "If there are ten or more creature cards total in all graveyards, this spell costs {6} less to cast.\\nFear (This creature can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)\\n{T}: Destroy target creature. It can't be regenerated.", "If you've been dealt damage by two or more creatures this turn, you may pay {R} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nInferno Trap deals 4 damage to target creature.", "Imprint — When Duplicant enters the battlefield, you may exile target nontoken creature.\\nAs long as a card exiled with Duplicant is a creature card, Duplicant has the power, toughness, and creature types of the last creature card exiled with Duplicant. It's still a Shapeshifter.", "Juggernaut attacks each combat if able.\\nJuggernaut can't be blocked by Walls.", 'Kazandu Refuge enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Kazandu Refuge enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', 'Khalni Garden enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Khalni Garden enters the battlefield, create a 0/1 green Plant creature token.\\n{T}: Add {G}.', 'Kicker {2} (You may pay an additional {2} as you cast this spell.)\\nBreath of Darigaaz deals 1 damage to each creature without flying and each player. If this spell was kicked, it deals 4 damage to each creature without flying and each player instead.', 'Kicker {X} (You may pay an additional {X} as you cast this spell.)\\nSaproling creatures and other Treefolk creatures get +1/+1.\\nWhen Verdeloth the Ancient enters the battlefield, if it was kicked, create X 1/1 green Saproling creature tokens.', 'Krosan Verge enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Krosan Verge: Search your library for a Forest card and a Plains card, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Llanowar Reborn enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nGraft 1 (This land enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it. Whenever a creature enters the battlefield, you may move a +1/+1 counter from this land onto it.)', 'Morph {2}{R} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Skirk Marauder is turned face up, it deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Multikicker {2} (You may pay an additional {2} any number of times as you cast this spell.)\\nEverflowing Chalice enters the battlefield with a charge counter on it for each time it was kicked.\\n{T}: Add {C} for each charge counter on Everflowing Chalice.', 'Nonartifact spells cost {1} more to cast.', 'Other Zombie creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn if {W} was spent to cast this spell. Each player loses 1 life for each attacking creature they control if {B} was spent to cast this spell. (Do both if {W}{B} was spent.)', 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Put a -1/-1 counter on target creature, two -1/-1 counters on another target creature, and three -1/-1 counters on a third target creature.', "Put target artifact or creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. Shuffle Beacon of Unrest into its owner's library.", 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. You lose life equal to its mana value.', "Put target creature on top of its owner's library, then fateseal 2. (To fateseal 2, look at the top two cards of an opponent's library, then put any number of them on the bottom of that player's library and the rest on top in any order.)", "Rakdos Carnarium enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Rakdos Carnarium enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {B}{R}.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nForestcycling {2}, plainscycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Forest or Plains card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield with a mannequin counter on it. For as long as that creature has a mannequin counter on it, it has "When this creature becomes the target of a spell or ability, sacrifice it."', 'Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Return up to one target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield if {B} was spent to cast this spell. Creatures target player controls get +2/+0 and gain haste until end of turn if {R} was spent to cast this spell. (Do both if {B}{R} was spent.)', 'Sacrifice Sakura-Tribe Elder: Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Savage Twister deals X damage to each creature.', 'Secluded Steppe enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W}.\\nCycling {W} ({W}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +4/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-0 until end of turn.\\nTarget creature gets -0/-3 until end of turn.', 'Target player draws two cards and loses 2 life.', 'Target player gains 7 life.', "This spell can't be countered.\\nVolcanic Fallout deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.", 'This spell costs {1} more to cast for each target beyond the first.\\nFireball deals X damage divided evenly, rounded down, among any number of targets.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nMolimo, Maro-Sorcerer's power and toughness are each equal to the number of lands you control.", "Trample\\nWhenever Scion of Darkness deals combat damage to a player, you may put target creature card from that player's graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.\\nCycling {3} ({3}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'Tranquil Thicket enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nCycling {G} ({G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Unearth {B} ({B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', "When Architects of Will enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of target player's library, then put them back in any order.\\nCycling {U/B} ({U/B}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)", 'When Corpse Connoisseur enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a creature card, put that card into your graveyard, then shuffle.\\nUnearth {3}{B} ({3}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'When Festering Goblin dies, target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn.', 'When Fierce Empath enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a creature card with mana value 6 or greater, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', "When Oblivion Ring enters the battlefield, exile another target nonland permanent.\\nWhen Oblivion Ring leaves the battlefield, return the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control.", 'When Sundering Titan enters or leaves the battlefield, choose a land of each basic land type, then destroy those lands.', 'When you cast this spell, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\nAnnihilator 2 (Whenever this creature attacks, defending player sacrifices two permanents.)', 'When you control no other artifacts, sacrifice Synod Centurion.', 'Whenever Infectious Horror attacks, each opponent loses 2 life.', 'Whenever Skirk Commando deals combat damage to a player, you may have it deal 2 damage to target creature that player controls.\\nMorph {2}{R} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'Whenever a player casts a spell, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Forgotten Ancient.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may move any number of +1/+1 counters from Forgotten Ancient onto other creatures.', "Whenever an opponent casts a spell, Kaervek the Merciless deals damage equal to that spell's mana value to any target.", "Whenever you're dealt damage, put that many charge counters on Sun Droplet.\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, you may remove a charge counter from Sun Droplet. If you do, you gain 1 life.", 'Wickerbough Elder enters the battlefield with a -1/-1 counter on it.\\n{G}, Remove a -1/-1 counter from Wickerbough Elder: Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "You may pay {1} and return a basic land you control to its owner's hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nFieldmist Borderpost enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.", "You may pay {1} and return a basic land you control to its owner's hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nMistvein Borderpost enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.", '{1}, {T}: Add {B}{R}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{G}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {W}{U}.', '{1}{B}: Return Reassembling Skeleton from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{1}{U}{U}: Target permanent becomes an artifact in addition to its other types. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)\\n{3}{U}: Gain control of target artifact. (This effect lasts indefinitely.)', '{2}, {T}: Exile target permanent you control.\\n{2}, Sacrifice Synod Sanctum: Return all cards exiled with Synod Sanctum to the battlefield under your control.', "{2}, {T}: Flip a coin. If you win the flip, sacrifice Sorcerer's Strongbox and draw three cards.", '{2}{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Each other player loses 2 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.', '{3}{G}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.\\n{3}{W}: Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{B}, {T}, Discard a card: Add {B}{B}{B}.', '{B}: Regenerate Twisted Abomination.\\nSwampcycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Swamp card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', "{G}: Target land becomes a 1/1 creature until end of turn. It's still a land.\\n{2}{G}{G}{G}: Creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.", '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\nThreshold — {G}{W}: Nantuko Monastery becomes a 4/4 green and white Insect Monk creature with first strike until end of turn. It's still a land. Activate only if seven or more cards are in your graveyard.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}{C}.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Dreamstone Hedron: Draw three cards.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Add {W}, {U}, or {B}.', '{T}: Untap another target permanent.', "{U}, Sacrifice Aether Spellbomb: Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\n{1}, Sacrifice Aether Spellbomb: Draw a card.", "{U}, {T}, Return an artifact you control to its owner's hand: You may put an artifact card from your hand onto the battlefield.", '{W}, {T}: Regenerate target artifact.']
flavor: ['"By the time I got there, the heart had stopped. Fortunately, I was able to replace it with something better."', '"Do you smell something burning?"', '"Her mind is an incredible mix of emotion and power. Even if I could grasp it, I couldn\'t hold it for long."\\n—Jace Beleren, on Chandra Nalaar', '"How can we outrun the sky?"\\n—Hadran, sunseeder of Naya', '"I fear no army or beast, but only the morning fog. Our assault can survive everything else."\\n—Lord Hilneth', '"I have become a gourmet of sorts. Each soul has its own distinctive flavor. The art is in inviting the right company to the feast."', '"I\'ve seen death before. My mother succumbing to illness, my comrades bleeding on the battlefield . . . But I\'d never seen anything as dreadful as that."\\n—Taani, berserker of Etlan', '"Lightning lives in everything, in living flesh and growing things. It must be set free."\\n—Rakka Mar', '"Living scarecrows make a mockery of the natural order. Dead ones make fine hats."', '"My mind has changed. My strength has not."', '"My mind is the spread of the canopy. My heart is the embrace of the roots. I am deathless Llanowar, its fury and its peace."', '"Nature is the ultimate mindless destroyer, capable of power and ferocity no army can match, and the Gruul follow its example."\\n—Trigori, Azorius senator', '"Never corner a barbarian. You become the path of least resistance."\\n—Sarkhan Vol', '"Rats and jackals feast in his swath, but even they will not walk with him."\\n—Mangara', '"Release that which was never caged."\\n—Spellbomb inscription', '"Somehow it warps the Æther. It brings a strange weight, a blockade in the flow of spellcraft."\\n—Noyan Dar, Tazeem lullmage', '"The first birth celebrates life. The second birth mocks it."\\n—Mystic elder', '"These benighted worlds are thick with ignorance. I will educate them. They will listen, or they will die."', '"This is why we don\'t go out in banewasp weather."\\n—Rannon, Vithian holdout', '"This vulgar mimicry will end now."\\n—Desmera, perfect of Wren\'s Run', '"Wasted potential surrounds us. Lend me that bauble, and let me see what it can be made to be."', '"We order them to stand, they stand. We order them to wait, they wait. We order them to die, they die."\\n—Pontifex, elder researcher', '"We speak the dragons\' language of flame and rage. They speak our language of fury and honor. Together we shall weave a tale of destruction without equal."', '"Words lie. People lie. The land tells the truth."', '"You are the grandest of all," said the archdruid to the trees. They became so proud of bark and branch that they suffered no creature to fly overhead or perch upon a bough.', '"You helped save my people from a Phyrexian fate. Did you think I wouldn\'t return the favor?"\\n—Eladamri, to Gerrard', '"You know I accept only one currency here, and yet you have sought me out. Why now do you hesitate?"\\n—Xathrid demon', '"You will learn to earn death."\\n—Volrath', "A gwyllion's favorite trap is the vanity mirror. A bewitched piece of glass traps the looker's soul and does away with the body.", 'A vertical scream pierces the night air and echoes doom through the clouds.', 'After lightning struck the cliffs, the ore became iron, the iron became steel, and the steel became greaves. The lightning never left.', 'An emblem of a secret guild, the Dimir insignia is seen only by its own members—and the doomed.', 'As their supplies of etherium dwindled, mechanists sent gargoyles farther and farther afield in search of salvage.', "Baby dragons can't figure out humans—if they didn't want to be killed, why were they made of meat and treasure?", "Built with neither a way to steer nor a way to stop, the juggernauts were simply aimed at an enemy's best defenses and told to charge.", "Creations made in madness may contain great power. The path to that power is as labyrinthine as the creator's mind.", 'Dragon lords of Jund rule by edicts of flame.', 'Eidren, perfect of Lys Alana, ordered hundreds of trees uprooted and rearranged into a pattern he deemed beautiful. Thus the Gilt-Leaf Wood was born.', 'Every grave cradles a recruit.', "Goblins journey to the sacrificial peaks in pairs so that the rare survivor might be able to relate the details of the other's grisly demise.", 'Gruul territorial markings need not be legible. The blood, snot, and muck used to smear them are unmistakably Gruul.', 'Hatred outlives the hateful.', 'In life, it was a fetid, disease-ridden thing. In death, not much changed.', 'In the autumn, she casts her seeds across the streets below, and come spring, her children rise in service to the Conclave.', 'In the blur between metal and flesh, Memnarch found madness.', 'It is a monument as austere, unyielding, and inscrutable as Esper itself.', 'It shreds its prey as each head fights for the choicest bits.', 'Its blood is life. Its body is growth.', "Life's circle has become inverted in Grixis. The same energy is endlessly recycled and becomes more stagnant with each pass.", 'Made of bone and boiled in blood, a Rakdos signet is not considered finished until it has been used as a murder weapon.', 'Not once in the history of Grixis has anyone died of old age.', 'Only a focused mind can survive it.', 'Only in Ravnica do the wolves watch the flock.', 'Only leonin clerics who can survive the Razor Fields for one turning of the suns can stand in the Cave of Light.', 'Only the Eldrazi mind thinks in the warped paths required to open the hedrons and tap the power within.', "Shadowmoor's main crops are rot, slime, and despair.", 'Simun the Quiet filled the chest with his most precious thoughts. But in a fit of paranoia, he locked up the memory of where he hid the key.', 'Slain orochi warriors were buried with a tree sapling so they would become a part of the forest after death.', 'Sometimes the wise ones wove their magic into living plants; as the plant grew, so grew the magic.', 'Such is the power of Rakdos that even his shadow takes on a cruel life of its own.', 'The maze-like design embodies the core of Azorius law—strict structure designed to test wills and stall change.', "The nomads' funeral pyres are more practical than ceremonial.", 'The parched earth still shielded those few souls with the heart to call it home.', 'The power of a waterfall. The fury of an avalanche. The intellect of a gale-force wind.', 'The undead of Grixis are fueled by their hatred of the living.', 'The world is the body. The mana is the blood. The witch is the surgeon.', "Their skeletons can be found all over Skirk Ridge, tangled in each other's horns.", 'This secret society of mages manipulates the beliefs and opinions of others.', "Though you may see the same bones, you'll never see the same skeleton twice.", "Urza's metathran children were conceived, birthed, and nurtured by an integrated system of machines.", "Vulshok mana rituals echo the day when the red sun burst through Mirrodin's surface to take its place in the heavens."]
artist: ['Alan Pollack', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Austin Hsu', 'Ben Thompson', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Chuck Lukacs', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Dana Knutson', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Dorman', 'David Day', 'DiTerlizzi', 'Dominick Domingo', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Francis Tsai', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Fred Fields', 'Gao Yan', 'Gary Ruddell', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Heather Hudson', 'Howard Lyon', 'Ian Edward Ameling', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jason Felix', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Jim Murray', 'Jim Nelson', 'John Avon', 'John Matson', 'Justin Sweet', 'Kaja Foglio', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Luca Zontini', 'Mark Hyzer', 'Mark Romanoski', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Martina Pilcerova', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Matthew D. Wilson', 'Michael Bruinsma', 'Nottsuo', 'Paolo Parente', 'Paul Lee', 'Pete Venters', 'Philip Straub', 'Quinton Hoover', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rebecca Guay', 'Richard Kane Ferguson', 'Rob Alexander', 'Robert Bliss', 'Ron Spears', 'Ron Spencer', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Sam Wood', 'Shelly Wan', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Susan Van Camp', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Val Mayerik', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
